- This is a rust port of the original C++ code (src/platformio/osww-server).
- When assessing code in the rust port - always consider the original C++ code (src/platformio/osww-server) for context.
- make sure you are using latest version of the dependencies.

# External references

## esp32 book
I have included the rust-esp32 book, which contains best practices for developing rust code for the esp32 - specifically HAL.
You should refer to it to ensure development is done with best practices.

## embassy codebase/book

I have included the embassy codebase, which contains the embassy library and book.
Refer to it to gather samples for example usage and best practices.
